{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the year 2022, Lindoso Anomaly, the terrible oilyman, invaded gyms and bodybuilding stages worldwide with his evil oil...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But only these five bodybuilders can save the muscle world from the eternal oil: Torugu, Big Uncle, Philip Flango, Raymond and Stronger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Muscle Apocalypse&quot; is a quick 2D platform shooter game inspired by memes from the Brazilian bodybuilding and fitness universe, with its main objective on making the player smile! This is a parody that combines comedy, bodybuilding, and fun, without using real names, images, or brands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>CONTROLS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613930/extras/Controls_en.png?t=1743517382\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2613930?t=1743517382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613930/daf6b33b69fed686e99d63e2dcf0451448b64eb1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743517382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743517382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743517382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The characters in this game are bodybuilding athletes, and for this reason, they wear swimsuits and bathing attire. Furthermore, due to the inclusion of bodybuilding in a satirical manner, the game features satire related to the use of pharmacological erg